This project demonstrates practical, hands-on use of the core Linux command-line operations required by the assignment: creating/renaming files and directories, viewing file contents, searching text with grep, archiving with zip/unzip, downloading files with wget, managing permissions with chmod, and working with environment variables via export. All commands are reproducible using the scripts provided in this repository.\par
